    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "OZARK AIRLINES\nP.O. BOX 10007, DEPT. 61\nLAMBERT-ST. LOUIS INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\nST. LOUIS, MO. 63145\n2016.113.188",
      "N\nNORTHWEST\nAIRLINES®\n\"Flight Schedule\nEffective\nJune 7-\nSept. 2, 2002\nFor nonstop\n\u0026 direct\nflights\nKLM\nLABILL\nAlaska\nPurchase tickets online at www.nwa.com.\ncall Northwest Airlines 9t1-800-225-2525\nor call your tray\nelagent.",
      "Free Trips!\nWin a free trip, or get closer to flying for\nfree, when you surf and shop on the\nNorthwest Airlines® WorldVacations™ web site.\nTrip Giveaways\nEvery month we give away air and hotel for two to one of\nthe many sublime vacation destinations we offer. Check the\nweb site each month to see where you could win a trip!\n2,500 Bonus Miles\nBook your vacation online and each person will earn an\nadditional 2,500 WorldPerks® Bonus Miles just for booking one\nof our qualifying destinations online. Add that to the 500 to 2,000\nWorldPerks Bonus Miles you receive with each World Vacations\npackage, plus the miles you get for flying Northwest Airlines and\nyou'll be that much closer to a free flight later on.\nPlanning Your Vacation\nWhether you're just in the planning stages or ready to\nbook, make sure to check out our web site. We offer all\nthe information you need to plan and book your vacation\nwith a few clicks of your mouse.\nWorld Vacations packages are available to just about\nanywhere you'd like to go:\nAsia\nCanada\n7 Europe\nMexico\nThe Caribbean\nU.S.A.\nwww.nwaworldvacations.com\n©2002 Northwest Airlines Inc.\nMP3010\nNORTHWEST\nAIRLINES\nWorld Vacations\nwww.nwaworldvacations.com"
    ],
